<title>KENYA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN V SOUTH AFRICA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN V SOUTH AFRICA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard in the Kenyan centenary</p>
<p>four-nation one-day tournament final between South Africa and</p>
<p>Pakistan on Sunday.</p>
<p>Pakistan</p>
<p> Saeed Anwar c Richardson b Donald		 32</p>
<p> Salim Elahi c Kirsten b de Villiers	     30</p>
<p> Shahad Afridi c Richardson b Donald	     14</p>
<p> Ijaz Ahmed c Richardson b McMillan		47</p>
